.DS_Store
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Disposable root-level GitHub Pages build output. The leading slashes are
# intentional: an unanchored `sentences/` also hides Resources/Sentences on a
# case-insensitive filesystem, preventing new source audio from being committed.
# Actions restores these generated pages from its validated render cache.
/word/
/story/
/stories/
/sentences/
/word-game/
/pronunciation/
/updates/
/sitemap.xml
/page-manifest.json
/build/
/.pages-cache/
